re: Explore a strange and surreal world as Richard seeks to find his way back to reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind-Twisting Puzzles: Manipulate objects to uncover clues and find a way through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for VR and PC Alike: Experience reality and unreality in a truly immersive fashion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Eye Tracking: Chart a trail to the answers you seek via object highlighting and environmental event triggers in non-VR mode at launch, with Tobii support also coming for VR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support: Tracked controllers, gamepad, and keyboard/mouse are all supported</p></li></ul>","developers":["Marslit Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510390/header.jpg?t=1760103126","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2018 Fulqrum Publishing Ltd. Developed by Marslit Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"metacritic":{"score":48,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/unknown-fate?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/510390/183184/03a183a52afc60cda7c6e99e78d7892602a6cd41/1751295123/dash_av1.mpd?t=1536253565","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/510390/183184/03a183a52afc60cda7c6e99e78d7892602a6cd41/1751295123/dash_h264.mpd?t=1536253565","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/510390/183184/03a183a52afc60cda7c6e99e78d7892602a6cd41/1751295123/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1536253565","id":256728017,"name":"Launch Trailer 6.9.2018","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256728017/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1536253565"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/510390/179041/b7af6f7ddd122f94f3a75f7b78813b247b050a